join Chrisostome center
Chrisostome:  I … I didn't know if you'd come back. I got you one anyway.
- Ask about the monsters
	catherine: Have you seen the monster who lives by the lake? Sharp dressed, doesn't blink much. The tales about him are unsettling.
	Chrisostome:  Stay away from him. He's not cruel, exactly, but he's not safe either. Not for a human, alone.
	set {EndingTracking.catherine_sympathy} -= 1.0
	set {ChapterTracking.is_evil} = true
- Ask about the creature, out of curiosity
	catherine:  Have you seen the creature who lives by the lake? Sharp-dressed, doesn't blink much.
	Chrisostome: He's... actually not so bad, from what I've seen. Keeps to himself, minds his business. I don't think he'd hurt you.
	set {EndingTracking.catherine_sympathy} += 1.0
	set {ChapterTracking.is_evil} = false